        "id": 1308749
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-04-18T14:42:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Another alternative is to use `SYS_INIT()`, if the Realtek specific stuff is moved to a separate file.\n\nThe Realtek specific stuff probably should be part of the existing driver.\n\nNothing under the `platform/ec/zephyr` directory should use legacy EC services, such as HOOKs and deferred calls.  You should use the Zephyr equivalent instead.",
      "parentUuid": "bc4b080d_6a91b925",
